      "requirement_text": "Interior trim materials shall meet the flammability requirements of CVM-MS-610 and the\nodor requirements of CVM-MS-612, and the supplier shall submit test results from a\nlaboratory accredited according to the Corvane laboratory policy CVM-LAB-005.",
